    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="81b3f511-c1f3-5d43-94e2-dbbaba25b211" activityNameId="76422a70-1793-5743-bf98-70ad93fbf9ac" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, mounted, Desktop PC mainboard, Pb containing, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, mounted, Desktop PC mainboard, Pb containing, at plant
The data represent a typical Desktop PC mainboard, used in modern computers. Material data are taken from the literature and own dismantling activities. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions.;
UUID: 51325b60-e32b-3be2-b7f8-38a7ec8e1255
This dataset covers component input and production efforts (incl. PWB waste due to failure in mounting) for the production of Desktop PC mainboards, using Pb-containing solder material.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (solder paste production line)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own dismantling 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_51325b60-e32b-3be2-b7f8-38a7ec8e1255.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
